{
  "id": "E392",
  "title": "Chair or Table",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2020-01-02",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming’s Dad wants to buy a new table. But, does Little Ming’s Mom agree?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50392/02359584703a2163044418500819647d1978576a.mp3?1577460881",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "椅子比桌子便宜\n\n小明的爸爸：我们买新的桌子吧。\n小明的妈妈：怎么了？\n小明的爸爸：这个桌子太低了。\n小明的妈妈：我觉得不低啊。\n小明的爸爸：可是我比你高啊。所以我觉得低。\n小明的妈妈：给你买新椅子吧。椅子比桌子便宜。\n",
    "traditional": "椅子比桌子便宜\n\n小明的爸爸：我們買新的桌子吧。\n小明的媽媽：怎麼了？\n小明的爸爸：這個桌子太低了。\n小明的媽媽：我覺得不低啊。\n小明的爸爸：可是我比你高啊。所以我覺得低。\n小明的媽媽：給你買新椅子吧。椅子比桌子便宜。\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "A chair is cheaper than a table"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸：我们买新的桌子吧。",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸：我們買新的桌子吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba wǒ men mǎi xīn de zhuō zi ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Dad: Let’s buy a new table."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈：怎么了？",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽：怎麼了？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma zěn me le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Mom: Why?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸：这个桌子太低了。",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸：這個桌子太低了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba zhè ge zhuō zi tài dī le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Dad: This table is too low."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈：我觉得不低啊。",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽：我覺得不低啊。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma wǒ jué de bù dī a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Mom: I don’t think it’s low."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸：可是我比你高啊。所以我觉得低。",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸：可是我比你高啊。所以我覺得低。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba kě shì wǒ bǐ nǐ gāo a suǒ yǐ wǒ jué de dī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Dad: But I’m taller than you. So, I think it’s low."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈：给你买新椅子吧。椅子比桌子便宜。",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽：給你買新椅子吧。椅子比桌子便宜。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma gěi nǐ mǎi xīn yǐ zi ba yǐ zi bǐ zhuō zi pián yi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Mom: Let’s buy a new chair for you. A chair is cheaper than a table."
    }
  ],
